RockTunnel_1F_Text_LennyIntro::
    .string "This tunnel goes\n"
    .string "a long way.\p"
    .string "Longer than it\n"
    .string "should.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_LennyDefeat::
    .string "You win.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_LennyPostBattle::
    .string "Watch for Onix.\p"
    .string "Watch for other\n"
    .string "things too.\p"
    .string "Things that don't\n"
    .string "show on Flash.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_OliverIntro::
    .string "I think I'm lost.\p"
    .string "The tunnel rearranges\n"
    .string "itself.\p"
    .string "I've passed this\n"
    .string "spot three times.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_OliverDefeat::
    .string "Which way is out?$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_OliverPostBattle::
    .string "The Snorlax on\n"
    .string "Schlummerweg II forced\n"
    .string "me to detour.\p"
    .string "I wish I'd\n"
    .string "stayed there.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_LucasIntro::
    .string "Show me respect.\p"
    .string "Something in this\n"
    .string "tunnel showed me\n"
    .string "something I didn't\n"
    .string "want to see.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_LucasDefeat::
    .string "I give.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_LucasPostBattle::
    .string "You're talented enough\n"
    .string "to hike.\p"
    .string "Talented enough to\n"
    .string "leave quickly too.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_AshtonIntro::
    .string "Pokemon fight!\n"
    .string "Ready, go!\p"
    .string "Something here fights\n"
    .string "without being seen.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_AshtonDefeat::
    .string "Game over.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_AshtonPostBattle::
    .string "I'll catch a\n"
    .string "Zubat on the way out.\p"
    .string "At least I\n"
    .string "can see Zubat.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_LeahIntro::
    .string "Don't try anything\n"
    .string "funny in the dark.\p"
    .string "The dark already\n"
    .string "tried something funny.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_LeahDefeat::
    .string "Too dark.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_LeahPostBattle::
    .string "I saw a\n"
    .string "Machop in this tunnel.\p"
    .string "It was running away\n"
    .string "from something.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_DanaIntro::
    .string "I came looking\n"
    .string "for wild Pokemon.\p"
    .string "I found something\n"
    .string "that wasn't wild.\p"
    .string "It was waiting.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_DanaDefeat::
    .string "I'm out.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_DanaPostBattle::
    .string "You looked harmless.\p"
    .string "So did everything\n"
    .string "else in here.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_ArianaIntro::
    .string "You have Pokemon.\n"
    .string "Let's start.\p"
    .string "Something else in\n"
    .string "here also wanted\n"
    .string "to start something.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_ArianaDefeat::
    .string "You play hard.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_ArianaPostBattle::
    .string "I'm sweating.\p"
    .string "Not from the battle.$"

RockTunnel_1F_Text_RouteSign::
    .string "FELSMORN\n"
    .string "Tiefbruch {LEFT_ARROW}{RIGHT_ARROW} Nebelruf\p"
    .string "Some who enter\n"
    .string "from one side\n"
    .string "exit from the other\n"
    .string "looking different.$"
